0..73 Comment "// A cell introduced with a value on the face it is fixed on violates its"
74..148 Comment "// boundary: the boundary law and β at that point rewrite one term to two"
149..227 Comment "// normal forms, and the block\'s rules are refused by name. The extension type"
228..305 Comment "// of `../../model/extension/zero-fiber.gandr` introduces a cell by its value"
306..335 Comment "// off the face alone (#641)."
337..412 Comment "/// `ins` takes the cell\'s value at both points, so `out0(ins(x, y))` reads"
413..461 Comment "/// `zero` by the boundary and `x` by β (#641)."
